[h2]Build 0.9.15[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Animated conveyor arms:[/b] an arm now reaches into its source, closes its gripper on the item, swings round carrying it, sets it down on the belt or in the machine, and swings back. The item really is in the arm while it moves (and counts as on its way), so what you see is what is happening.
[*]If there is no room on the output side when the arm gets there, it holds the item until there is.
[/list]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Correction to the last notes: Feeders at the repair center's resource spots need Mending Solutions build 0.9.128 or later.
[/list]
